## ⚠️ Error Handling Tips

- Add Try/Catch blocks around HTTP requests
- Log errors to Notion or Slack
- Retry failed image uploads
- Validate Notion and LinkedIn tokens before execution

---

## 📌 Best Practices

- Test with a draft post first
- Use environment variables for API keys
- Monitor execution logs regularly
- Keep image sizes optimized (<5MB)
- Maintain consistent posting schedule

---

## 🛠 Optional Enhancements

- Add Slack notifications for failures
- Include analytics tracking
- Support multiple languages
- Add A/B testing for headlines
- Integrate with Google Analytics

